{"unit_id":"tag:05Y0:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们继续《态射（Morphisms）的进一步讨论》第<REF_0001>节中开始的讨论。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）。给定概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>，可以考虑二元组（pairs）<MATH_0006>，其中<MATH_0007>是态射（morphism），而<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>上的态射（morphism）。图示为<MATH_0010>。当然，也可以将<MATH_0011>视为态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，使得<MATH_0013>交换（commutes）。在这种情形下，可以定义函子（functor）<MATHSEG_0001> 如上<MATHSEG_0002>。有时我们将其视为定义在<MATH_0014>上概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上的函子（functor），此时从记号中略去<MATH_0015>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"二元组"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"空词表；引用章名暂定。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"空词表；概形暂定。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"二元组","context":"空词表；参数二元组暂定。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"空词表；态射暂定。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"空词表；图的交换性暂定。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"空词表；函子暂定。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"空词表；复数形式暂定。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"空词表；范畴暂定。"}],"notes":[]}
